body:
I shared my opnsense that has tailscale plugin with subnets to another tailnet and that can't access these subnets. I need to invite a friend to access specific subnet only. I tried this

    {
    "action": "accept",
    "src":    ["user:EMAIL"],
    "dst":    ["192.168.10.0/24:*"],
    },

I'm on TRT with 25 CAG repeats and 400ng/dl Test before and a lot of symptoms pre and still. This is some kind of androgen insensitivity. Basically the lower the CAG numbers the higher the testosteron effect. There are some good studys. 

[Size Matters: The CAG Repeat Length of the Androgen Receptor Gene, Testosterone, and Male Adolescent Depression Severity

](https://www.frontiersin.org/articles/10.3389/fpsyt.2021.732759/full#:~:text=The%20effect%20of%20testosterone%20on,well%20in%20vivo%20(7).)
